   "section": "engine/engine/dialogs/microtxn/ShowPurchasable.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "For every donations you've ever made you have earned voratun coins. These can be spent purchasing expansions or options on the online store. This is the amount you have left, if your purchase total is below this number you'll instantly get your purchase validated, if not you'll need to donate some more first.\n#GOLD##{italic}#Thanks for your support, every little bit helps the game survive for years on!#{normal}#",
   "target": "你的每一笔捐赠都会获得沃瑞钽硬币，可用于购买扩展包或在线商店中的商品。这里显示的是你剩余的硬币数量；如果购买总额低于此数值，购买会立即生效，否则你需要先追加捐赠。\n#GOLD##{italic}#感谢你的支持，每一分助力都能让这款游戏长久延续下去！#{normal}#",
   "source_file": "game/engines/default/engine/engine/dialogs/microtxn/ShowPurchasable.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": []
  },
