  {
   "id": "46a1fdd523bd",
   "unit_id": "46a1fdd523bd7814d4e10e19b505a8742d3357f7ae8f294ca5f87d1f064fe4fe",
   "revision_key": "bea09237bdd86d2d5b15d9cf1cc027dfced82bcb60c029baace0789c89be10db",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 23458,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/cunning/scoundrel.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Your melee and ranged attacks leave your foes unable to focus on any complex actions, giving them a stacking 3%% chance of failure the next time they try to use a talent (to a maximum of %d%%).\n\t\tIf any effect causes the target's turn to fail they fumble and injure themself, taking %0.2f physical damage.\n\t\tIf the turn loss was caused by this effect then Fumble is removed.\n\t\tThe damage dealt increases with your Cunning.\n\t\t",
   "target": "你的近战和远程攻击会让敌人难以集中精力进行复杂行动，在下一次尝试使用技能时获得可叠加的 3%% 失败几率（最高 %d%%）。\n\t\t如果任何效果导致目标该回合行动失败，对方会失手伤到自己，受到 %0.2f 点物理伤害。\n\t\t如果回合行动失败是由笨拙效果引起的，则会移除笨拙效果。\n\t\t伤害受灵巧加成。\n\t\t",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/talents/cunning/scoundrel.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    183
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "5afa5478601c",
   "unit_id": "5afa5478601c17263f80255b47489dd4405c15b19b902a571c7b1c8b81da0272",
   "revision_key": "6f1ce4f4068d9b8f7b94778af4824b2edcd5f6668151fe5717c2887ded22ba8f",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 25703,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/gifts/summon-melee.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Summon a Minotaur for %d turns to attack your foes. Minotaurs cannot stay summoned for long, but they deal high damage.\n\t\tIt will get %d Strength, %d Constitution and %d Dexterity.\n\t\tYour summons inherit some of your stats: increased damage%%, resistance penetration %%, stun/pin/confusion/blindness resistance, armour penetration.\n\t\tThe minotaur's Strength and Dexterity will increase with your Mindpower.",
   "target": "召唤一只米诺陶攻击敌人，持续 %d 回合。米诺陶在场时间不长，但能造成高额伤害。\n\t\t它拥有 %d 点力量、%d 点体质和 %d 点敏捷。\n\t\t你的召唤物会继承你部分属性：伤害加成%%、抗性穿透%%、震慑/定身/混乱/致盲抵抗和护甲穿透。\n\t\t米诺陶的力量和敏捷受精神强度加成。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/talents/gifts/summon-melee.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    413
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "e5b60119fbd6",
   "unit_id": "e5b60119fbd6a7bc12e822eafae058995ffa59876d73880cbb6b17773d2b8d59",
   "revision_key": "d3836e2002bc528c2a9b35166b840421d653a7fa3bdb0985f6b590d17eee1e4e",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 27333,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/psionic/feedback.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Use Feedback to replenish yourself.  This heals you for %d life, and restores %d stamina, %d mana, %d equilibrium, %d vim, %d positive and negative energies, %d psi energy, and %d hate.\n\t\tThe heal and resource gain will improve with your Mindpower.",
   "target": "消耗反馈值来恢复自身：恢复 %d 点生命值、%d 点体力、%d 点法力，降低 %d 点失衡值，并恢复 %d 点活力、各 %d 点正能量与负能量、%d 点灵能及 %d 点仇恨。\n\t\t治疗量和资源回复量受精神强度加成。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/talents/psionic/feedback.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    139
   ]
  },
  {
